---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import PageHero from '../../components/PageHero.astro';
import Section from '../../components/Section.astro';
import CtaBanner from '../../components/CtaBanner.astro';
import ArrowLink from '../../components/ArrowLink.astro';
import Placeholder from '../../components/Placeholder.astro';
---
<BaseLayout
  title="Handover Day | Get the Keys to Your New Home | UEC"
  description="Handover is the day you get the keys to your new home. Here’s what UEC gives you on the day and how we support you afterwards."
>
  <PageHero
    title="Step 8: Handover, the day your dream becomes home"
    image="/images/s5.jpg"
    crumbs={[{ label: 'Process', href: '/process/' }]}
    crumb="Handover"
    tabs="process"
  >
    <p class="lead">This is the day we’ve all been working towards. We hand over the keys to your new home, along with everything you need to look after it.</p>
    <ArrowLink class="btn btn-white btn-lg" href="/contact/" slot="actions">Book an initial consultation</ArrowLink>
  </PageHero>

  <Section num="01" title="What you’ll receive">
    <p><Placeholder>[CLIENT TO CONFIRM: handover pack contents.]</Placeholder></p>
    <ul class="dlist">
      <li>Keys and access remotes</li>
      <li>Warranty information for your home and appliances</li>
      <li>Manuals and care instructions</li>
      <li>Certificates and compliance documents</li>
      <li>Contact details for after-handover support</li>
    </ul>
  </Section>

  <Section num="02" title="Looking after you after handover" alt>
    <p>Our job doesn’t end when you move in. <Placeholder>[CLIENT TO CONFIRM: maintenance period, e.g. how long after handover they return to fix minor items, and how clients report issues.]</Placeholder></p>
    <p>Under SA law, statutory warranties apply to domestic building work, and claims can be made up to five years from completion, according to the Legal Services Commission of SA.</p>
  </Section>

  <Section num="03" title="Share your story">
    <p>We’d love to hear about your experience. <Placeholder>[CLIENT TO CONFIRM: link to Google reviews.]</Placeholder></p>
  </Section>

  <CtaBanner title="Ready to start your own journey?">
    <ArrowLink class="btn btn-sand btn-lg" href="/contact/">Book an initial consultation</ArrowLink>
  </CtaBanner>
</BaseLayout>
